    "execution": "Hash-pinned selected functions in a CPU host based at 0x3f0000: 0x42a685 trig initialization, 0x445020 scalar MD3 interpolation, 0x4420b0 culling. Original sphere/box callbacks replaced with recording stubs. Earlier entity/beam observations also execute first. No original entry point is called.",
